before:
Changing direction to bottom makes the ramp run downward instead of rightward.
```css
.demo { writing-mode: horizontal-tb; direction: ltr; }
.banner { width: 240px; height: 80px; background-image: linear-gradient(to bottom, navy 0%, teal 100%); } .banner span { color: white; background: black; }
```

after:
The banner blends navy into teal toward the right.

```css
.banner {
  width: 240px;
  height: 80px;
  background-image: linear-gradient(to right, navy 0%, teal 100%);
}
.banner span {
  color: white;
  background: black;
}
```

The span holds the label. Its solid black background keeps the white words separate from the changing colors.
